<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>AXIS Allocation Estimator | Points, Trajectories &amp; Discord Role</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Estimate your $AXIS contributor airdrop allocation from your on-chain Axis Robotics trajectories, epoch points and Discord role (X / Y / Z Axis). Unofficial community tool." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#06070b" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="bg-orbs" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
  <div class="bg-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="wrap topbar-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="AXIS Allocation Estimator home">
        <svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true">
          <g stroke="url(#gm)" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round">
            <line x1="20" y1="4" x2="20" y2="36" /><line x1="6" y1="12" x2="34" y2="28" /><line x1="6" y1="28" x2="34" y2="12" />
          </g>
          <defs><linearGradient id="gm" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#5dffc4" /><stop offset="1" stop-color="#8b7bff" /></linearGradient></defs>
        </svg>
        <span>AXIS<b>Estimator</b></span>
      </a>
      <span class="pill" id="network-pill"><i class="dot"></i><span id="network-status">Connecting to Base…</span></span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Unofficial community tool · Base mainnet</p>
      <h1>Estimate your <span class="grad">$AXIS</span> allocation</h1>
      <p class="lede">Paste your wallet to pull your <b>verified trajectories</b> straight from the Axis AttemptRegistry on Base, add your <b>total points</b> and <b>Discord role</b>, and see an estimated share of the contributor pool with its unlock schedule.</p>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="stat glass"><span class="k">Contributor pool (assumed)</span><span class="v">50,000,000</span><span class="u">AXIS · 5% of supply</span></div>
        <div class="stat glass"><span class="k">Network trajectories (on-chain)</span><span class="v" id="net-records">—</span><span class="u">AttemptRegistry.totalRecords()</span></div>
        <div class="stat glass"><span class="k">Network avg quality score</span><span class="v" id="net-score">—</span><span class="u">sampled from recent blocks</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid-main">
      <!-- INPUTS -->
      <form class="card glass" id="estimator-form" autocomplete="off">
        <div class="card-head"><span class="step">01</span><h2>Your contributor profile</h2></div>

        <label class="field" for="wallet-input">
          <span class="lbl">Wallet address <em>(used on Axis Hub)</em></span>
          <div class="input-row">
            <input id="wallet-input" type="text" placeholder="0x…" spellcheck="false" />
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" id="scan-btn">Scan chain</button>
          </div>
          <span class="hint" id="wallet-hint">Reads getUserRecordCount() and samples your record scores.</span>
        </label>

        <div class="scan-result" id="scan-result" hidden>
          <div><span class="k">Trajectories</span><span class="v" id="r-count">—</span></div>
          <div><span class="k">Est. valid</span><span class="v" id="r-valid">—</span></div>
          <div><span class="k">Avg score</span><span class="v" id="r-score">—</span></div>
          <div><span class="k">Sim. hours</span><span class="v" id="r-hours">—</span></div>
          <div><span class="k">First record</span><span class="v" id="r-first">—</span></div>
          <div><span class="k">Latest record</span><span class="v" id="r-last">—</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="row-2">
          <label class="field" for="hub-username">
            <span class="lbl">Axis Hub username <em>(optional)</em></span>
            <input id="hub-username" type="text" placeholder="e.g. robo_arif" />
          </label>
          <label class="field" for="discord-username">
            <span class="lbl">Discord name <em>(optional)</em></span>
            <input id="discord-username" type="text" placeholder="e.g. arif#0001" />
          </label>
        </div>

        <fieldset class="field">
          <legend class="lbl">Discord role</legend>
          <div class="roles" id="role-picker">
            <label class="role" data-role="none"><input type="radio" name="role" value="none" id="role-none" checked /><span class="r-name">No role</span><span class="r-mult" data-mult-for="none">1.00×</span></label>
            <label class="role" data-role="x"><input type="radio" name="role" value="x" id="role-x" /><span class="r-name">X Axis</span><span class="r-mult" data-mult-for="x">1.25×</span></label>
            <label class="role" data-role="y"><input type="radio" name="role" value="y" id="role-y" /><span class="r-name">Y Axis</span><span class="r-mult" data-mult-for="y">1.50×</span></label>
            <label class="role role-top" data-role="z"><input type="radio" name="role" value="z" id="role-z" /><span class="r-name">Z Axis</span><span class="r-mult" data-mult-for="z">2.00×</span></label>
          </div>
          <span class="hint">Discord roles can't be read from a username, so pick yours. Z Axis is the highest.</span>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="card-head sub"><span class="step">02</span><h2>Total points</h2></div>
        <div class="row-2">
          <label class="field" for="total-points">
            <span class="lbl">Your points</span>
            <input id="total-points" type="text" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="e.g. 12,500" value="" />
          </label>
          <label class="field" for="network-points">
            <span class="lbl">Network total points</span>
            <input id="network-points" type="text" inputmode="numeric" value="36,000,000" />
          </label>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" id="estimate-btn">Estimate my allocation <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
      </form>

      <!-- RESULTS -->
      <section class="card glass results" id="results" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="card-head"><span class="step">03</span><h2>Your estimate</h2></div>

        <div class="empty" id="results-empty">
          <div class="empty-mark" aria-hidden="true">✳</div>
          <p>Scan your wallet and/or enter your epoch points, then press <b>Estimate</b>.</p>
        </div>

        <div id="results-body" hidden>
          <div class="identity" id="identity"></div>
          <div class="big">
            <span class="k">Estimated allocation</span>
            <span class="v"><span id="alloc-value">0</span> <small>AXIS</small></span>
            <span class="range">Range <b id="alloc-low">0</b> – <b id="alloc-high">0</b> AXIS · ≈ <b id="alloc-usd">$0</b> at $0.10 sale price</span>
          </div>

          <div class="breakdown">
            <div class="b-row"><span>Points share</span><span id="b-points">—</span></div>
            <div class="b-row"><span>Trajectory share</span><span id="b-traj">—</span></div>
            <div class="b-row"><span>Quality factor</span><span id="b-quality">—</span></div>
            <div class="b-row"><span>Role multiplier</span><span id="b-role">—</span></div>
            <div class="b-row"><span>Share of pool</span><span id="b-pool">—</span></div>
            <div class="b-row"><span>Rank estimate</span><span id="b-rank">—</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="vesting">
            <div class="v-head">
              <h3>Unlock schedule</h3>
              <select id="vesting-select" aria-label="Vesting schedule">
                <option value="sale">Sale terms: 25% TGE · 6m cliff · 6m linear</option>
                <option value="ten">10% TGE · 6m cliff · 6m linear</option>
                <option value="full">100% at TGE</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="chart" id="vesting-chart" role="img" aria-label="Cumulative unlock chart"></div>
            <div class="v-legend"><span><i class="sw sw-tge"></i>TGE unlock</span><span><i class="sw sw-lin"></i>Linear unlock</span><span class="muted" id="v-summary"></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </section>

    <section class="disclaimer glass">
      <h3>Read this first</h3>
      <p>Axis Robotics has <b>not announced</b> a contributor airdrop size, formula, role multipliers or vesting. Everything here is an <b>estimate built on assumptions</b> you can edit. Trajectory data is read live from the
        <a href="https://basescan.org/address/0xf91a90baa9e044da084df369445a59d859d640db" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AttemptRegistry contract</a>; points and roles are what you enter. This tool never asks you to connect or sign with a wallet. Official news only from <a href="https://x.com/axisrobotics" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@axisrobotics</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="wrap foot">Unofficial · not affiliated with Axis Robotics · read-only, no wallet connection</footer>

  <script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
